services=render_road_hero('Services','One partner.<br>Every step of the way.','From your first shortlist to your next set of keys, Done Deal brings clarity to the process.','services-coastal-road')+f'''<section class="wrap service-detail" id="buy-lease"><div class="detail-number">01</div><div><h2>New-car buying<br>&amp; leasing.</h2><p class="lead">The right vehicle is only half the equation. The deal matters, too.</p><p>Share your priorities, preferred models and budget. We help explore options and negotiate the offer, looking beyond the monthly payment to the terms and upfront costs.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Vehicle preferences and budget discussion</li><li>Options explained in plain language</li><li>Help comparing the overall offer</li></ul>{button('Request a quote')}</div></section><section class="wrap service-detail" id="trade-return"><div class="detail-number">02</div><div><h2>Your current car.<br>Your next move.</h2><p class="lead">Trading in or nearing the end of a lease? Start with a clear view of your options.</p><p>Tell us about your current vehicle and timing. We’ll discuss how a trade-in or lease return fits into the next deal, and what information is needed to move forward.</p>{button('Discuss my options','/request-a-quote/?interest=trade')}</div></section><section class="wrap service-detail" id="delivery"><div class="detail-number">03</div><div><h2>A thoughtful<br>final handoff.</h2><p class="lead">Local delivery can make the last step easier.</p><p>Ask about availability for your location and vehicle. Delivery arrangements, timing and any related costs are confirmed individually before you proceed.</p>{button('Ask about delivery','/contact/')}</div></section>'''+cta()
about=render_road_hero('About','Car buying, with Done Deal in your corner.','A more personal way to find the right vehicle and a better overall deal.','about-mountain-road')+f'''<section class="about-grid wrap"><div class="about-panel"><span>PERSONAL SERVICE.<br>FROM START TO FINISH.</span><strong>Good advice.<br>Clear options.<br><em>Done Deal.</em></strong></div><div><h2>A better way to get<br>behind the wheel.</h2><p>Done Deal starts with a simple idea: getting your next car shouldn’t mean doing all the work yourself.</p><p>We work with customers to understand their priorities, explore vehicle options and negotiate the details. Done Deal guides the process from search to handoff, so you can move forward without starting the conversation over at every dealership.</p><p>The goal is a better overall deal, less legwork and a process you can feel good about.</p>{button('Start a conversation','/contact/')}</div></section><section class="wrap approach"><h2>The way we work.</h2><div class="three"><article><span class="number">01</span><h3>Listen first.</h3><p>Your priorities shape the search. The right fit starts with understanding how you drive and what you want to spend.</p></article><article><span class="number">02</span><h3>Look at the whole deal.</h3><p>A headline price doesn’t tell the full story. We pay attention to the details that affect the overall offer.</p></article><article><span class="number">03</span><h3>Keep it personal.</h3><p>Clear communication and personal guidance, from your first question to the next step.</p></article></div></section>'''+cta()
contact=render_road_hero('Contact','Your next great deal<br>starts with hello.','A quick question, a vehicle in mind, or a fresh start. We’re ready when you are.','contact-open-road')+f'''<section class="wrap contact-grid"><div class="contact-card"><span class="number">CALL</span><h2>Talk it through.</h2><p>Connect with Done Deal about your next vehicle.</p>{button('Give us a call','tel:+16315257010',True)}</div><div class="contact-card"><span class="number">TEXT</span><h2>On the move?</h2><p>Send your questions whenever it suits you.</p>{button('Send us a text','sms:+16315257010',True)}</div><div class="contact-card wide"><span class="number">EMAIL</span><h2>A little more detail?</h2><p>Tell us what you’re looking for.</p>{button('Send us an email','mailto:info@donedealautogroup.com',True)}</div></section><section class="wrap contact-next"><h2>Have a vehicle in mind?</h2><p>Send your preferences and budget so we can start with the full picture.</p>{button('Request a quote')}</section>'''
