california=intro('','From California<br>to a Done Deal.','Christina’s 2026 Mercedes-Benz GLS 450: thousands saved and an early lease exit with no additional charges.')+f'''<section class="wrap case-body christina-story"><aside><dl><dt>Customer</dt><dd>Christina</dd><dt>Location</dt><dd>California</dd><dt>New vehicle</dt><dd>2026 Mercedes-Benz GLS 450</dd><dt>The outcome</dt><dd>Thousands saved compared to her original dealership quote</dd><dt>Existing lease</dt><dd>Exited early with no additional charges</dd></dl></aside><article><img class="case-story-image" src="/assets/christina-mercedes.webp" width="1080" height="1440" alt="Christina waving from the driver’s seat of her white Mercedes-Benz GLS 450"><section class="case-chapter"><h2>The car she wanted.<br>A deal worth a second look.</h2><p>When Christina decided it was time for a new vehicle, she had her heart set on a beautiful <strong>2026 Mercedes-Benz GLS 450</strong>. She had already visited her local dealership in California and received a quote, but she wanted to make sure she was getting the best deal possible.</p><p>That’s when she reached out to Done Deal Auto Group.</p></section><section class="case-chapter"><h2>More savings.<br>A fresh start.</h2><p>We helped Christina save <strong>thousands of dollars compared to her original dealership quote</strong>. We also helped her get out of her existing lease early <strong>with no additional charges</strong>.</p><p>Despite being on opposite sides of the country, we made the entire process simple, convenient, and stress-free.</p></section><section class="case-chapter"><h2>Congratulations, Christina!</h2><p>Helping people save money, avoid dealership headaches, and drive the cars they love is what Done Deal Auto Group is all about.</p><p>Thank you for trusting us all the way from California. Enjoy your beautiful new Mercedes-Benz!</p></section><div class="case-takeaway"><h3>Already have a dealership quote?</h3><p>Bring it to the conversation. Let’s take a closer look at your options and the overall deal.</p>{button('Let’s talk about your deal')}</div><a class="text-link" href="/customer-stories/">All customer stories</a></article></section>'''
virginia=intro('','More room.<br>For Ed’s growing family.','A new Toyota Sienna, delivered to his home in Virginia.')+f'''<section class="wrap case-body customer-story"><aside><dl><dt>Customer</dt><dd>Ed</dd><dt>Location</dt><dd>Virginia</dd><dt>New vehicle</dt><dd>Toyota Sienna</dd><dt>Existing lease</dt><dd>Exited early</dd><dt>The handoff</dt><dd>Home delivery and driveway pickup</dd></dl></aside><article><img class="case-story-image" src="/assets/ed-sienna.webp" width="1440" height="1126" alt="Ed standing beside his silver Toyota Sienna"><section class="case-chapter"><h2>A growing family.<br>An easy switch.</h2><p>Ed’s family was growing, but his car didn’t get the memo. With more kids joining the crew, it was time for a little less squeezing in and a lot more room.</p><p>That’s where Done Deal Auto Group stepped in. We helped Ed get out of his lease early and into a new Toyota Sienna with room for the whole family. Then we handled the trip to Virginia, delivering his new Sienna right to his home and picking up his old vehicle from his driveway.</p><p>No dealership visits. No figuring out how to get one car home and return the other. Just an easy switch, so Ed could spend more time with the people who made the upgrade necessary.</p></section><a class="text-link" href="/customer-stories/">All customer stories</a></article></section>'''+cta()
liz=intro('', 'A fresh start.<br>A new Acura MDX.', 'Done Deal matched Liz’s trade-in offer and helped her lease a brand-new Acura MDX.')+'''<section class="wrap case-body customer-story"><aside><dl><dt>Customer</dt><dd>Liz</dd><dt>Location</dt><dd>Long Island, NY</dd><dt>New vehicle</dt><dd>Acura MDX</dd><dt>Previous car</dt><dd>Over 100,000 miles</dd><dt>Trade-in</dt><dd>Matched another dealership’s offer</dd></dl></aside><article><img class="case-story-image" src="/assets/liz-mdx.webp" width="1080" height="1440" alt="Liz beside her Acura MDX, with the license plate blurred"><section class="case-chapter"><h2>Time for an upgrade.</h2><p>Liz’s car had crossed the 100,000-mile mark, and she was ready for something new. She came to Done Deal Auto Group to help make the switch.</p></section><section class="case-chapter"><h2>A trade-in offer matched.</h2><p>We matched the trade-in value another dealership offered for her car and helped her lease a brand-new Acura MDX. From an older car with plenty of miles to a fresh start in a new Acura, we made the switch easy.</p><p>Congratulations, Liz! Thanks for trusting Done Deal Auto Group with your next chapter.</p></section><a class="text-link" href="/customer-stories/">All customer stories</a></article></section>'''+cta()

joanne=intro('', 'A better price.<br>Days of shopping saved.', 'Joanne had already visited several dealerships. Done Deal took over the search and found her a better deal.')+'''<section class="wrap case-body customer-story"><aside><dl><dt>Customer</dt><dd>Joanne</dd><dt>Location</dt><dd>Long Island, NY</dd><dt>Starting point</dt><dd>Multiple dealership visits and quotes</dd><dt>The outcome</dt><dd>A better deal and days of research saved</dd></dl></aside><article><img class="case-story-image" src="/assets/joanne-car.webp" width="1080" height="1440" alt="Joanne beside her new car, with the license plate blurred"><section class="case-chapter"><h2>One too many dealership visits.</h2><p>Joanne had already visited multiple dealerships looking for the best price. The shopping trips and time spent comparing quotes were adding up, so she reached out to Done Deal Auto Group for help.</p></section><section class="case-chapter"><h2>A better deal, with less work.</h2><p>We took it from there, finding Joanne a better deal and saving her days of additional research. Less money spent, less time shopping, and one less thing on her to-do list.</p><p>Thank you for trusting us, Joanne! We’re glad we could make your car search a whole lot easier.</p></section><a class="text-link" href="/customer-stories/">All customer stories</a></article></section>'''+cta()

quote=intro('LET’S FIND YOUR NEXT CAR','Your preferences.<br>Our next move.','Tell us a little about what you’re looking for. We’ll follow up to talk through your options.')+'''<section class="wrap quote-layout"><form id="quote-form" method="post" action="/api/quote"><noscript><p>Please <a href="mailto:quotes@donedealautogroup.com">email Done Deal</a> or call (631) 525-7010 to request a quote.</p></noscript><div class="quote-delivery" aria-live="polite"><h2 id="delivery-heading">Prepare here. Send from your email.</h2><p id="delivery-note">Fill in your details, review your request, then open your email app and press Send. Nothing is sent by this form.</p><p>This is an inquiry, not a credit application or a commitment to purchase. Prefer to talk? <a href="tel:+16315257010">Call (631) 525-7010</a>.</p></div><div class="form-heading"><p>Fields marked * are required.</p></div><div id="form-errors" class="form-errors" tabindex="-1" hidden></div><fieldset class="form-section"><legend>Your contact details</legend><div class="form-grid"><label>Full name *<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="100" placeholder="Your full name"></label><label>Email address *<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="254" placeholder="you@example.com"></label><label>Phone number<input name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="30" placeholder="(555) 000-0000"></label></div></fieldset><fieldset class="form-section"><legend>Your plans</legend><div class="form-grid"><label class="full">I’m looking to *<select name="interest" required><option value="">Select an option</option><option>Buy a new car</option><option>Lease a new car</option><option>Trade in a vehicle</option><option>Return a lease</option><option>Explore my options</option></select></label><label class="full"><span id="vehicle-label">Vehicle preferences *</span><input name="vehicle" required maxlength="250" aria-describedby="vehicle-hint" placeholder="Make, model, or what matters most"><small id="vehicle-hint">Still deciding? Tell us what matters most, or write “Not sure yet.”</small></label><label id="budget-field"><span id="budget-label">Budget (optional)</span><input name="budget" maxlength="100" placeholder="Total or monthly, plus upfront budget"></label><label data-interests="Trade in a vehicle|Return a lease" hidden>Current mileage (optional)<input name="mileage" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="30" placeholder="Approximate mileage" disabled></label><label data-interests="Return a lease" hidden>Lease end date (optional)<input name="leaseEnd" type="month" disabled></label><label>When are you looking?<select name="timing"><option>Just exploring</option><option>As soon as possible</option><option>Within 1 month</option><option>Within 3 months</option><option>Later this year</option></select></label><label class="full">Anything else we should know?<textarea name="notes" rows="4" maxlength="2000" placeholder="Current vehicle, an offer you received, or questions for Done Deal"></textarea></label></div></fieldset><div class="honey" aria-hidden="true"><label>Leave empty<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div><label class="consent"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" required><span>I agree that Done Deal may contact me about this request using the details I provide. *</span></label><p class="form-note">Please don’t include credit applications, Social Security numbers or financial documents.</p><div id="turnstile"></div><p class="submit-reassurance">After you send, we’ll review your request and contact you to discuss your options.</p><button class="button" type="submit" id="submit-quote">Prepare my request</button><div id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><section id="email-actions" class="request-review" hidden aria-labelledby="request-review-heading"><h2 id="request-review-heading" tabindex="-1">Review your request</h2><p id="request-send-note">Your request has not been sent. Open your email app, check the message, then press Send.</p><p class="request-recipient">To: <a href="mailto:quotes@donedealautogroup.com">quotes@donedealautogroup.com</a></p><label for="request-preview">Your message</label><textarea id="request-preview" rows="10" readonly></textarea><div class="actions"><a class="button" id="email-link">Open email app</a><button type="button" class="button secondary" id="copy-request">Copy message</button><button type="button" class="button secondary" id="edit-request">Edit details</button></div><p class="form-note">No email app opening? Copy the message above and paste it into your preferred email service. Send it to the address shown here.</p></section></form><aside class="quote-aside"><h2>A conversation.<br>Then a plan.</h2><ol><li>We review what you’re looking for.</li><li>We connect with you to discuss the details.</li><li>We explore the next steps together.</li></ol><div class="aside-contact"><p>Prefer to talk it through?</p><a href="tel:+16315257010">(631) 525-7010</a><a href="mailto:quotes@donedealautogroup.com">Email Done Deal</a></div><p class="form-note">This is an inquiry, not a credit application or a commitment to purchase.</p></aside></section>'''
